---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { CONTACT_INFO } from '../data/products';
---

<Layout
  title="Our Story & Mission | Pranatpal Singh | ArmXchange"
  description="Learn how national-level 10m air rifle shooter and coach Pranatpal Singh founded ArmXchange to solve equipment discovery, cylinder safety, and resale challenges for Indian athletes."
>
  <div class="container" style="padding-top: 28px; padding-bottom: 88px;">
    <!-- Breadcrumb -->
    <nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" style="font-size: 0.82rem; color: var(--color-text-muted); margin-bottom: 24px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;">
      <a href="/" style="color: var(--color-ink); font-weight: 500;">Home</a> 
      <span style="color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 0.75rem;">/</span>
      <span style="color: var(--color-text-muted);">Founder & Mission</span>
    </nav>

    <!-- Header -->
    <div style="margin-bottom: 48px; max-width: 860px;">
      <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 14px;">
        <span class="tech-badge">THE ARMXCHANGE MANIFESTO</span>
        <span style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.74rem; color: var(--color-text-muted); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.06em;">
          COACH-FOUNDED PLATFORM
        </span>
      </div>
      <h1 style="font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 4vw, 3.2rem); margin-bottom: 18px; color: var(--color-ink); font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.03em; line-height: 1.15;">
        Built From The Firing Line: Every Athlete Deserves Honest Hardware.
      </h1>
      <p style="font-size: 1.1rem; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--color-text-body);">
        ArmXchange was not created in a corporate boardroom. It was founded on the 10-meter firing line by national-level shooter and coach <strong>Pranatpal Singh</strong>, inspired by the persistent equipment discovery and safety hurdles faced by competitive shooters across India.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Founder Grid -->
    <div style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-radius: var(--radius-card); padding: 48px 40px; margin-bottom: 64px; box-shadow: var(--shadow-card);">
      <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.15fr 0.85fr; gap: 48px; align-items: center;" class="about-grid">
        <div>
          <span class="tech-badge" style="margin-bottom: 14px;">THE SPORTING REALITY</span>
          <h2 style="font-size: 1.8rem; margin-bottom: 16px; color: var(--color-ink); font-weight: 800;">
            The Equipment Barrier in Indian Shooting Sports
          </h2>
          <p style="font-size: 0.96rem; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px; color: var(--color-text-body);">
            Starting out in competitive shooting sports is demanding. Precision match air rifles like Feinwerkbau, Walther, and Steyr are sophisticated mechanical and electronic instruments manufactured in Germany, Austria, and Switzerland. For junior shooters and their families, committing several lakhs of rupees upfront is a massive undertaking.
          </p>
          <p style="font-size: 0.96rem; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px; color: var(--color-text-body);">
            Yet, senior shooters upgrading to modern chassis had no transparent, trustworthy marketplace to consign their maintained rifles to emerging junior marksmen. The existing pre-owned market was fragmented, opaque, and hazardous: undisclosed expired cylinders (past the 10-year ISSF rule), worn regulator seals, and arbitrary pricing.
          </p>
          <p style="font-size: 0.96rem; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--color-text-body);">
            ArmXchange was created to establish a new benchmark: item-specific condition reports, verified cylinder dates, authentic macro photography, and direct coach-to-athlete consultation.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div style="background: var(--color-canvas-subtle); border-radius: var(--radius-card); padding: 36px 32px; border: 1px solid var(--color-border);">
          <div style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.74rem; color: var(--color-text-muted); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.08em; margin-bottom: 14px;">
            FOUNDER STATEMENT //
          </div>
          <blockquote style="font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--color-ink); margin-bottom: 24px; font-weight: 500;">
            &ldquo;When I coach my students, I want their attention focused entirely on breathing, trigger reset, and natural point of aim. They should never have to wonder whether their cylinder is past its 10-year test date, or if their diopter is skipping clicks. ArmXchange was built to give every shooter complete certainty.&rdquo;
          </blockquote>
          <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px; padding-top: 18px; border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);">
            <div style="width: 44px; height: 44px; border-radius: var(--radius-sm); background: var(--color-ink); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-weight: 800; color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 1rem; font-family: var(--font-mono);">
              PS
            </div>
            <div>
              <div style="color: var(--color-ink); font-size: 0.96rem; font-weight: 700;">{CONTACT_INFO.founder}</div>
              <div style="font-size: 0.78rem; color: var(--color-text-muted); font-family: var(--font-mono);">{CONTACT_INFO.founderTitle}</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Core Values -->
    <div style="margin-bottom: 64px;">
      <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 40px;">
        <span class="tech-badge" style="margin-bottom: 8px;">OPERATIONAL PRINCIPLES</span>
        <h2 style="font-size: 1.8rem; color: var(--color-ink); font-weight: 800;">
          The ArmXchange Protocol
        </h2>
      </div>
      <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 280px), 1fr)); gap: 20px;">
        <div style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-radius: var(--radius-card); padding: 32px;">
          <div style="width: 36px; height: 36px; border-radius: var(--radius-sm); background: var(--color-canvas-subtle); border: 1px solid var(--color-border); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: var(--color-ink); margin-bottom: 16px;">
            <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"></circle>
              <line x1="21" y1="21" x2="16.65" y2="16.65"></line>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 style="font-size: 1.15rem; color: var(--color-ink); margin-bottom: 8px; font-weight: 700;">Absolute Disclosure</h3>
          <p style="font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--color-text-body);">
            We never use generic stock imagery for pre-owned weapons. If an air cylinder is 2018 or 2024, or if there is light cosmetic wear on the cheekpiece, it is clearly stated in writing and documented in high-resolution photography.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-radius: var(--radius-card); padding: 32px;">
          <div style="width: 36px; height: 36px; border-radius: var(--radius-sm); background: var(--color-canvas-subtle); border: 1px solid var(--color-border); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: var(--color-ink); margin-bottom: 16px;">
            <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"></path>
              <path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 style="font-size: 1.15rem; color: var(--color-ink); margin-bottom: 8px; font-weight: 700;">Statutory Compliance</h3>
          <p style="font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--color-text-body);">
            We deal exclusively in 0.177 calibre (4.5mm) target air weapons generating under 20 Joules under Category III(f) of the Indian Arms Rules 2016. Complete tax transparency is maintained with 18% GST guidance for non-renowned athletes.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-radius: var(--radius-card); padding: 32px;">
          <div style="width: 36px; height: 36px; border-radius: var(--radius-sm); background: var(--color-canvas-subtle); border: 1px solid var(--color-border); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: var(--color-ink); margin-bottom: 16px;">
            <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle>
              <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="6"></circle>
              <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2"></circle>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 style="font-size: 1.15rem; color: var(--color-ink); margin-bottom: 8px; font-weight: 700;">Athlete Stewardship</h3>
          <p style="font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--color-text-body);">
            We prioritize the athletic progress of every marksman. If a junior shooter needs guidance on stock balance, grip sizing, or mechanical vs electronic triggers, our team offers objective coaching insight tailored to their physical build.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Direct Founder Consultation -->
    <div style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-radius: var(--radius-card); padding: 48px 32px; text-align: center; box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);">
      <div style="max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto;">
        <span class="tech-badge" style="margin-bottom: 14px;">DIRECT CONSULTATION</span>
        <h2 style="font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 2.8vw, 2.1rem); margin-bottom: 12px; color: var(--color-ink); font-weight: 800;">
          Speak Directly With Coach Pranatpal Singh
        </h2>
        <p style="margin-bottom: 28px; font-size: 0.95rem; color: var(--color-text-body); line-height: 1.65;">
          Have questions about equipment compatibility, transitioning from club rifles, or consigning your weapon? Connect directly via WhatsApp or phone.
        </p>
        <div style="display: flex; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px;">
          <a 
            href={`https://wa.me/${CONTACT_INFO.phoneRaw}?text=${encodeURIComponent('Hi Coach Pranatpal, I would like to consult with you regarding competition shooting equipment on ArmXchange.')}`}
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="btn btn-whatsapp-solid"
            style="padding: 12px 24px; font-size: 0.95rem;"
          >
            <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor">
              <path d="M12.031 6.172c-3.181 0-5.767 2.586-5.768 5.766-.001 1.298.38 2.27 1.019 3.287l-.582 2.128 2.182-.573c.978.58 1.911.928 3.145.929 3.178 0 5.767-2.587 5.768-5.766.001-3.187-2.575-5.77-5.764-5.771zm3.392 8.244c-.144.405-.837.774-1.17.824-.299.045-.677.063-1.092-.069-.252-.08-.575-.187-.988-.365-1.739-.751-2.874-2.502-2.961-2.617-.087-.116-.708-.94-.708-1.793s.448-1.273.607-1.446c.159-.173.346-.217.462-.217l.332.007c.106.005.249-.04.39.298.144.347.491 1.2.534 1.287.043.087.072.188.014.304-.058.116-.087.188-.173.289l-.26.304c-.087.086-.177.18-.076.354.101.174.449.741.964 1.201.662.591 1.221.774 1.394.86.174.086.274.072.376-.043.101-.116.433-.506.549-.68.116-.173.231-.145.39-.087s1.011.477 1.184.564.289.13.332.202c.045.072.045.419-.099.824z"/>
            </svg>
            <span>WhatsApp Coach Pranatpal</span>
          </a>
          <a 
            href={`tel:${CONTACT_INFO.phone}`}
            class="btn btn-secondary"
            style="padding: 12px 24px; font-size: 0.95rem;"
          >
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-8.63-3.07 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 0 1 4.11 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.72 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 .7 2.81 2 2 0 0 1-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 0 1 2.11-.45 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 2.81.7A2 2 0 0 1 22 16.92z"></path>
            </svg>
            <span>Call: {CONTACT_INFO.phoneDisplay}</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  @media (max-width: 868px) {
    .about-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr !important;
      gap: 32px !important;
    }
  }
</style>
